  << /ActualText (Personal Summary \072\n\nBack\055end developer with 3\053 years of experience building serverless systems on AWS \024 including e\055commerce checkout\054 payment integrations\054 and a global CMS platform at Unicity International\056 TypeScript microservices on AWS Lambda\054 infrastructure as code with AWS CDK\054 and multi\055stage CI\057CD pipelines\056 Daily practitioner of AI\055assisted development \050Claude Code\054 MCP\054 custom agent skills\051\056 Focused on scalable APIs\054 cloud infrastructure\054 and developer tooling\056\n)
