1105 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Experience\072\n\nSoftware Engineer \174 Unicity International \050MLBS\051 2024 \055 Present\nGlobal CMS Platform \055 international content management and enrollment system\nDevelop and maintain a global CMS platform serving Unicity\031s international markets \024 a monorepo comprising 24 AWS Lambda microservices\054 16 internal CLI tools\054 and React admin and enrollment web applications\056\nDesign and build RESTful APIs in TypeScript on Node\056js \057 AWS Lambda\054 backed by AWS DocumentDB \050MongoDB\055compatible\051\054 MemoryDB \050Redis\051 caching\054 and S3 storage\056\nDefine infrastructure as code with AWS CDK\054 including a shared Lambda stack construct reused across all services\073 develop and test services locally with LocalStack and Docker\056\nShip through a multi\055stage CI\057CD pipeline \050dev \222 qa \222 uat \222 prod\051 on GitHub Actions with branch\055based deployments and automated post\055deploy tests\056\nContribute to the React 18 \053 TypeScript frontend \050MUI\054 Vite\054 Turborepo\051\nCollaborate with cross\055functional teams to translate user stories into scalable backend solutions and integrate server\055side logic with front\055end features\056\nBack\055end Developer \174 Unicity International \050MLBS\051 2023 \055 2024\nE\055commerce system\nDeveloped an e\055commerce backend serving Unicity\047s international markets \024 AWS Lambda microservices supporting customer enrollment and checkout flows\056\nDesigned RESTful APIs in JavaScript on AWS Lambda\054 backed by Amazon Aurora \050MySQL\051\056\nIntegrated third\055party payment APIs in collaboration with the payment team\056  \n\nService Engineer \174 Hytera Communications 2022\nPrepared and configured radio communication devices \050PoC\054 TETRA\054 DMR\054 analog\051 for customer demonstrations and proof\055of\055concept testing\056\nSupported customers in system administration and quota management\073 configured and installed device parameters using CPS tooling\056\n\nSystem Design Engineer \174 AZO Ltd\056 2018\0552021\nTranslated sales requirements into product system designs and produced Process Flow Diagrams \050PFD\051 in LogoCAD and AutoCAD\056\nCoordinated with procurement and project teams on design and equipment costing\073 prepared quotations in SAP\056\nDelivered system designs for clients including Mead Johnson\054 PTT\054 and JD Food\056\n)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 1106 0 R
     /Pg 1096 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
